\image(figures/conditional_gan_derivatives.svg)
// result_end

\caption(Native autodiff supplies all three curves. These are scalar-pool derivatives; larger pools divide each branch by its own size. At the same score, D's real derivative and G's fake derivative coincide; the red curve overlays blue.)
